// chriz-iwd-encounters 340: once Maiden Ilmadia has turned hostile, her fire giants
// and drow turn with her and the giants gather at her side (on top of the forge's
// area script); their own scripts take over when they see the party. Ordered from
// the area script: in the lab far neutral creatures did not run their own scripts.
// CIE_ILM_RALLY (area): 1 sent.

IF
  Global("CIE_ILM_RALLY","MYAREA",0)
  Allegiance("%cie_ilm_name%",ENEMY)
  !Dead("%cie_ilm_name%")
THEN
  RESPONSE #100
    SetGlobal("CIE_ILM_RALLY","MYAREA",1)%cie_ilm_giants%
    Continue()
END
